(19, ' &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4nfkf4jf4j%; ÇÝßŸÇfbf4nfmf4jfhgb; ðÑŠñŸž™fjšæf9nŠ™Þ™žf4n#q4nq4nq4nq4nq4nq4n; dq3y&gt;\r\n              &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4nfkf4jf4j%; ÇÝßŸÇfbf4nfmf4jfhgb; ðÑŠñŸž™fjšæf9nŠ™Þ™žf4n#q4nq4nq4nq4nq4nq4n;dq3y&gt;\r\n                \r\n             &lt;fh fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3y ÇÝßŸÇfbf4nfmf4jfhgb; Œ™šfbf9nfnßgnÝf4nw1rf1rfhgb;fiÑžŸßšf9nÞÝŒfbf4nw2jf4jfhgbdq3y&gt;  &lt;Ñ ÇžÝŒiejrdq3yßšæÝgb.fhÇfhdq3y&gt;z7kfbžfjŠfbfjžÝfn&lt;/Ñ&gt;  &lt;/fh&gt;\r\n         \r\n           &lt;/æßgj&gt;\r\n\r\n       &lt;/æßgj&gt;\r\n      \r\n      &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4ng2nf4j%; fiÑžŸßšf9nÞÝŒfbf4nfmf2nfhgbdq3y&gt;\r\n      \r\n      &lt;ðž&gt;&lt;ðž&gt;\r\n    &lt;Ñ ÇžÝŒiejrdq3yfiÝšfjz8nŸfb.fhÇfhdq3y&gt; Â &lt;Œ™šfb Š™Þ™žiejrdq3y#w4rw4rw4rw4rw4rw4rdq3y fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yæßfnfhÞÑgmrf4nßšÞßšÝf9nðÞ™Šñdq3y&gt;&lt;fnfbž™šŸ&gt;z8nÝšfj z8nÑšÑŸÝfiÝšfb&lt;/fnfbž™šŸ&gt;&lt;/Œ™šfb&gt;&lt;/Ñ&gt; &gt;&gt; &lt;Ñ ÇžÝŒiejrdq3yÑææfEhÝghz8nÝšfj.fhÇfhdq3y&gt; Â &lt;Œ™šfb Š™Þ™žiejrdq3y#w4rw4rw4rw4rw4rw4rdq3y fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yæßfnfhÞÑgmrf4nßšÞßšÝf9nðÞ™Šñdq3y&gt;q5kææ fEhÝgh z8nÝšfj&lt;/Œ™šfb&gt;&lt;/Ñ&gt;\r\n    \r\n \r\n\r\n&lt;fnŠžßfhfb&gt;\r\n$(æ™ŠfjfiÝšfb).žÝÑægmr(ŒfjšŠfbß™š (){\r\n    $(q6tl#Œ™žfifnq6tl).™š(q6tlfi™fjfnÝfi™gjÝq6tl, ŒfjšŠfbß™š(){\r\n     gjÑž  wGhÝgjÝÞiejr$(q6tl#žÝfnfjÞfbq6tl).gjÑÞ();\r\n   //ÑÞÝžfb(wGhÝgjÝÞ);\r\n       ßŒ(wGhÝgjÝÞ iejriejr dq3yfLj™fj gGrÑgjÝ š™fb zErÝŸßfnfbÝžÝæ wGhÝgjÝÞ fk z8nÝšfjdq3y || wGhÝgjÝÞ iejriejr dq3yfLj™fj gGrÑgjÝ š™fb zErÝŸßfnfbÝžÝæ wGhÝgjÝÞ f1r z8nÝšfjdq3y ){\r\n      $(q6tl#ÞÝgjÝÞq6tl).gjÑÞ(fk);\r\n      \r\n     }\r\n     \r\n     \r\n   });\r\n\r\n     $(q6tl#ÞÝgjÝÞq6tl).™š(q6tlŠÇÑšŸÝq6tl,ŒfjšŠfbß™š(){\r\n     gjÑž z8nÝšfjwGhÝgjÝÞiejr$(fbÇßfn).gjÑÞ();\r\n     //   ÑÞÝžfb(z8nÝšfjwGhÝgjÝÞ);\r\n     gjÑž ÑþÑgbzErÝŽfjÝfnfb;\r\n   // $(dq3y#žÝfnfjÞfbdq3y).ÇfbfiÞ(q6tlq6tl);\r\n\r\n       ÑþÑgbzErÝŽfjÝfnfbiejr $.ÑþÑgb({\r\n            fjžÞf4n dq3y../ÑþÑgb.fhÇfhdq3y,\r\n            fbgmrfhÝf4n dq3yfh™fnfbdq