(81, '  \r\n    \r\n       &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4nfkf4jf4j%; ÇÝßŸÇfbf4nw4rf4jfhgb; ðÑŠñŸž™fjšæf9nŠ™Þ™žf4n#q4nq4nq4nq4nq4nq4n; dq3y&gt;\r\n              &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4nfkf4jf4j%; ÇÝßŸÇfbf4nfmf4jfhgb; ðÑŠñŸž™fjšæf9nŠ™Þ™žf4n#q4nq4nq4nq4nq4nq4n; fiÑžŸßšf9nÞÝŒfbf4nw2jf4jfhgbdq3y&gt;\r\n               &lt;ðž&gt; &lt;Çf1r&gt;z7kfbžfjŠfbfjžÝfn&lt;/Çf1r&gt;\r\n               &lt;/æßgj&gt;\r\n\r\n       &lt;/æßgj&gt;\r\n      \r\n      &lt;æßgj fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yghßæfbÇf4ng2nf4j%; fiÑžŸßšf9nÞÝŒfbf4nfmf2nfhgbdq3y&gt;\r\n      \r\n      &lt;ðž&gt;&lt;ðž&gt;\r\n    &lt;Ñ ÇžÝŒiejrdq3y../Ýæßfb™ž/fbÇÝfiÝfn.fhÇfhdq3y&gt;  &lt;Œ™šfb Š™Þ™žiejrdq3y#w4rw4rw4rw4rw4rw4rdq3y fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yæßfnfhÞÑgmrf4nßšÞßšÝf9nðÞ™Šñdq3y&gt;&lt;fnfbž™šŸ&gt;a9jÇÝfiÝfn fBkæßfb™ž&lt;/fnfbž™šŸ&gt;&lt;/Œ™šfb&gt;&lt;/Ñ&gt; &gt;&gt; &lt;Ñ ÇžÝŒiejrdq3yÑææfEhÝgha9jÇÝfiÝ.fhÇfhdq3y&gt;  &lt;Œ™šfb Š™Þ™žiejrdq3y#w4rw4rw4rw4rw4rw4rdq3y fnfbgmrÞÝiejrdq3yæßfnfhÞÑgmrf4nßšÞßšÝf9nðÞ™Šñdq3y&gt;q5kææ  fEhÝgh a9jÇÝfiÝ&lt;/Œ™šfb&gt;&lt;/Ñ&gt;\r\n    \r\n\r\n&lt;!f9nf9nf9nf9n fhÑfnfbÝ gh™žñ ðÝÞ™ghf9nf9n&gt;\r\n&lt;?fhÇfh\r\nßŒ (ßfnfnÝfb($_zBna7rz7ka9j[q6tlfnfjðfi™æfjÞÝq6tl])){\r\n\r\n$fi™æfjÞÝ_šÑfiÝiejr$_zBna7rz7ka9j[q6tlfbÝgbfbq6tl];\r\n$æÝfnŠiejr$_zBna7rz7ka9j[q6tlæÝfnŠq6tl];\r\n$fiæfjšæÝž iejr fnfjðfnfbž($fi™æfjÞÝ_šÑfiÝ,f4j,w2j);\r\n\r\nßŒ ($fiæfjšæÝž !iejrq6tlfbÇÝfiÝ_q6tl){\r\nÝŠÇ™ q6tl&lt;Çfk&gt;z7k™žžgmr!!! fLj™fjž a9jÇÝfiÝ fEhÑfiÝ fifjfnfb z7kfbÑžfb ghßfbÇ ..  fbÇÝfiÝ_ ........&lt;/Çfk&gt;q6tl;}ÝÞfnÝ{\r\n\r\n//ŸÞ™ðÑÞ $Š™ššÝŠfbf1ræð;\r\n  $Žžgmriejr $Š™ššÝŠfbf1ræðf9n&gt;fhžÝfhÑžÝ(dq3yfnÝÞÝŠfb * Œž™fi fbÇÝfiÝ_fbðÞ ghÇÝžÝ fbÇÝfiÝ_šÑfiÝiejrq6tl$fi™æfjÞÝ_šÑfiÝq6tldq3y);\r\n  $Žžgmrf9n&gt;ÝgbÝŠfjfbÝ();\r\nßŒ($Žžgmrf9n&gt;ž™ghq4n™fjšfb() &gt; f4j){\r\n  ÝŠÇ™ q6tl&lt;Çfk&gt;z7k™žžgmr!!! a9jÇÝfiÝ q5kÞžÝÑægmr fBkgbßfnfbfn.........&lt;/Çfk&gt;q6tl;\r\n}ÝÞfnÝ{ \r\n$æßžiejrq6tl../../ÞßŒÝfbÇÝfiÝfn/q6tl.$fi™æfjÞÝ_šÑfiÝ; \r\n$žÝfnfjÞfb iejr fiñæßž ($æßž, f4jf4hf4hf4h); \r\n$ŒfnæŒfn iejr ŠÇfi™æ ($æßž, f4